    acrobatic skills and mental faculties in preparation for a lifetime pushing the
    edge of what most consider possible. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Dexterity or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in
    the Acrobatics skill as well as the Warfare Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Cat
    Fall] skill feat.
